what's going on guys today we're going  to be theorizing what it would be like  if there was an additional shift in  attack on titan that was specifically  made to be underwater a titan of that  nature would have completely changed  naval warfare given that it would be  like a one-person mini submarine that  could also just start throwing punches  in this video i'll be breaking down all  the abilities that i think a sea titan  would need to have but there are a  couple important things worth mentioning  first number one is that pretty much any  titan can survive in the water because  breathing is not required for them to  live essentially meaning there is no  chance of a titan ever dying from  drowning and i assume the same rule  presumably applies to titan shifters as  well in the end credits for season 3 we  saw pure titans casually emerging from  the ocean like it was nothing and in the  mangrove confirmed beyond any doubt that  they can swim without needing to come up  for air that being said though even  though titans can survive in the water  none of them have features that are  specifically made for that environment  hence why migas said that they can't  intervene when it comes to naval  conflicts the second thing i wanted to  point out before we get into it was that  although an underwater shifter doesn't  exist it's entirely possible that a  previous beast titan was based off a sea  creature whether it be a whale a shark  or even a giant titan squid in my  opinion the opening for season two  definitely implied that might have been  the case and also a t-rex as well but  without further ado let's move over to  what powers the sea titan should have  and don't forget to smash that sub  button if you haven't already  okay so starting with this design most  of the body would be covered in blue  scales made from a new type of titan  hardening giving the shifter a degree of  camouflage in the water and also  allowing it to glide faster the scales  help to reduce water resistance so when  you combine that feature with its insane  physical strength webbed hands and the  right swimming technique it can propel  itself faster through the ocean than any  actual sea creature at its top speed it  can swim from the shore of parodies to  the mali and continent in just under 5  hours although it might take longer in  reality depending on the experience of  the user at the front of its mouth is a  special organ that was initially  inspired by humpback whales as those  creatures can emit a low frequency sound  wave to communicate with other wheels  over ridiculously long distances for the  underwater titan this organ can emit a  continuous pulse that is sent through  pars which can only be felt by the  holders of the other titan shifters once  the pulse is received they all become  aware of the underwater titan's location  with the signal getting more powerful  the closer they get the pulse works  regardless of whether the shifter is on  land or sea and it can be used as an sos  signal that would lead allies towards  its location the downside is that enemy  titan shifters would also know where the  underwater titan is hiding however with  the right tactics that could be a good  thing for lonely opposition into a trap  in order to fully explain what i mean by  that let's imagine a scenario in which  parodies are the ones who had this  shifter as it would have made their  strategy a lot more effective during the  declaration of war instead of sending in  yelena to try and trap the warriors the  sea titan could have camped underneath  the malian port and released a pulse  that all the warriors would have felt  that pulse would be felt incredibly  strongly by them considering the port  isn't that far away from where they were  and i reckon porker would immediately  storm off in that direction pique would  probably be following behind him to make  sure he doesn't get himself killed while  zeke would volunteer to remain near the  stage since he'd be planning to hit  travis on the airship pretty soon lara  tyber would have felt the pulse as well  and would likely tell her brother  straight away but as the final season  made clear willie knew he was going to  be attacked and was fully prepared to  die so in my mind i have no doubt that  he's still go ahead with his declaration  anyway remember that the first main step  in the attack on liberio was to prevent  as many ships as possible from getting  in eren's way so at the port the  underwater titan would continue to  generate that pulse until at least one  of the marlin warriors arrive  i think pique would be skeptical of  parodies decision to make their presence  known like this although for the sake of  this example we'd have to imagine that  they would still go towards it once  those two show up at the port then of  course the pulse would be revealed to be  a diversion as the sea titan could  propel itself far away at top speed  while the colossal tags in and blows the  place up by swimming away the sea titan  can quickly escape the blast radius but  those who wouldn't be able to escape  include thousands of civilians any  nearby ships and most importantly two  titan shifters that now can't intervene  in the main battle and also can't  intervene in any future battle as well  in this example you can see how the  pulse being sent to all shifters can be  a big benefit for luring enemies into  traps and in that aspect the colossal  and sea titans would make a nice tag  team  moving on when it comes to the amount of  transformations the shifter can do in a  single day there are a few factors  involved including the energy required  to make it the natural endurance of that  titan and sometimes the extent of the  user's injuries for the sea titan  however i imagine there would be a  different factor that has the biggest  impact and that is whether or not the  user is on dry land or in the water when  they're attempting to transform i kind  of felt like there needed to be one more  thing that would make sure the shifter  stays in the water most of the time  given that in theory someone could just  decide to use this mainly on land even  though it wasn't necessarily designed  for that bearing that in mind if the  user of the underwater titan is on the  surface then they can only transform one  time and they won't be able to do it  again until their human body is  completely submerged in water it doesn't  necessarily have to be water from the  ocean i mean i guess it could be a lake  or a public pool but as long as the  specific criteria is met and the human  body is in the water completely then it  should be able to do a maximum of five  consecutive transformations on a given  day  additionally as you would expect from a  shifter with this name its eyes would  have adapted so it seems better  underwater compared to the other titans  in all honesty i have no idea how  clearly most titans can see when they're  submerged in water but all i know is  that for me personally without goggles  it looks like i'm seeing things in 240p  resolution a shifter made for the water  definitely shouldn't have that type of  problem although if it starts going  hundreds and hundreds of meters deep  then yeah it might need to get a  flashlight with that all explained i  guess the final feature to mention is  that its height would be 70 meters tall  putting it in the same class as the  beast titan and it would have enough  stamina for around 6 to 10 hours of  intense swimming a day  if marley had this thing then it's  guaranteed they'd use it for naval  warfare as commander mcgather revealed  the malian navy was lacking compared to  other countries with a titan like this  they'd likely use it to destroy enemy  fleets by charging into the battleships  one by one but inevitably the other  nations would develop technology to  specifically counter this threat  as a random side note if this was an  actual titan then i'm fairly certain  there would be a brutal swimming  schedule added to the malian warrior  candidate program on the flip side  parodies could have really done with the  shifts themselves as it's pretty much  the perfect titan to have if you're  going to send a spy to learn more about  mali if we had to pick someone to  inherit it who is not already a titan  shifter then i say it would probably go  to jean or maybe hanji but the trouble  with her is that yes she would gather  the most information but she's also the  most likely to blow her cover without  levi there to keep her in check  anyhow in summarizing the abilities of  the sea titan it has a couple physical  features to help it glide faster through  the water and at its top speed it should  be the fastest sea creature on the  planet  obviously the speed varies depending on  the experience of the user and how well  they've been trained but as a general  rule it should take no longer than 7  total hours to swim from mali to  paradise importantly it also has the  power to send a continuous pulse through  parts that will always alert other  shifters to its location the strength of  the pulse will give each individual  shifter a good idea of how close or far  away they might be and although the  pulse is continuous it can be turned on  and off at any given time thirdly the  sea titan has good eyesight in the water  and can transform a maximum of once a  day on the surface but five times  overall let me know down below in the  comments what do you think of this titan  and also who in parodies would be chosen  to inherit it if the islands somehow  managed to take it for themselves  thanks for watching as always and if you  haven't seen it already then don't  forget to check out my video on the past  titan as that was the other shifter i  thought would be a cool addition to the  series until the next one peace out

